{"seq":3,"slug":"modular-rag","title":"模块化 RAG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rag-knowledge-systems/rag-architecture/modular-rag","wordCount":820,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块化-rag\">模块化 RAG</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模块化 RAG 是将 RAG 系统拆分成独立、可替换的模块，每个模块有明确的职责和接口。这种架构模式借鉴了微服务的设计理念，但粒度更细——模块通常在同一进程内通过接口调用，而非网络通信。模块化设计的核心价值在于降低变更成本：当你需要替换嵌入模型、升级检索策略或切换 LLM 供应商时，只需要修改对应模块的实现，其他模块完全不受影响。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么需要模块化\">为什么需要模块化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单体 RAG 的问题</th>\n<th>模块化 RAG 的好处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码耦合</td>\n<td>模块独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难以修改</td>\n<td>易于替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难以测试</td>\n<td>易于测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难以复用</td>\n<td>易于复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队协作困难</td>\n<td>团队协作容易</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rag-的模块划分\">RAG 的模块划分</h2><h3 id=\"核心模块\">核心模块</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[用户接口&lt;br/&gt;Interface] --&gt; B[编排层&lt;br/&gt;Orchestrator]&#10;    B --&gt; C[查询处理&lt;br/&gt;Query Processor]&#10;    B --&gt; D[检索器&lt;br/&gt;Retriever]&#10;    B --&gt; E[上下文构建器&lt;br/&gt;Context Builder]&#10;    B --&gt; F[答案生成器&lt;br/&gt;Answer Generator]&#10;    D --&gt; G[向量数据库&lt;br/&gt;Vector DB]&#10;    C --&gt; H[嵌入模型&lt;br/&gt;Embedding Model]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I[LLM]\">graph TB\n    A[用户接口&lt;br/&gt;Interface] --&gt; B[编排层&lt;br/&gt;Orchestrator]\n    B --&gt; C[查询处理&lt;br/&gt;Query Processor]\n    B --&gt; D[检索器&lt;br/&gt;Retriever]\n    B --&gt; E[上下文构建器&lt;br/&gt;Context Builder]\n    B --&gt; F[答案生成器&lt;br/&gt;Answer Generator]\n    D --&gt; G[向量数据库&lt;br/&gt;Vector DB]\n    C --&gt; H[嵌入模型&lt;br/&gt;Embedding Model]\n    D --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I[LLM]</pre><h3 id=\"模块职责详解\">模块职责详解</h3><h4 id=\"1-用户接口-interface\">1. 用户接口 (Interface)</h4><p><strong>职责</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>接收用户输入</li>\n<li>返回用户输出</li>\n<li>格式化交互</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例实现</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>REST API</li>\n<li>Web UI</li>\n<li>命令行</li>\n<li>聊天界面</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"2-编排层-orchestrator\">2. 编排层 (Orchestrator)</h4><p><strong>职责</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>协调整个流程</li>\n<li>调用各个模块</li>\n<li>处理错误</li>\n<li>记录日志</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>核心逻辑</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"def orchestrate(query):&#10;    processed_query = query_processor.process(query)&#10;    docs = retriever.retrieve(processed_query)&#10;    context = context_builder.build(query, docs)&#10;    answer = answer_generator.generate(context)&#10;    return answer\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>def orchestrate(query):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    processed_query = query_processor.process(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    docs = retriever.retrieve(processed_query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    context = context_builder.build(query, docs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    answer = answer_generator.generate(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return answer</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"3-查询处理器-query-processor\">3. 查询处理器 (Query Processor)</h4><p><strong>职责</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>查询重写</li>\n<li>查询扩展</li>\n<li>查询分解</li>\n<li>多查询生成</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>接口示例</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"interface QueryProcessor {&#10;  process(query: string): ProcessedQuery&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface QueryProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  process(query: string): ProcessedQuery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"4-检索器-retriever\">4. 检索器 (Retriever)</h4><p><strong>职责</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>查询向量化</li>\n<li>相似度搜索</li>\n<li>元数据过滤</li>\n<li>结果重排</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>接口示例</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"interface Retriever {&#10;  retrieve(query: string, topK: number): Document[]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface Retriever {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  retrieve(query: string, topK: number): Document[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"5-上下文构建器-context-builder\">5. 上下文构建器 (Context Builder)</h4><p><strong>职责</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择文档</li>\n<li>排序文档</li>\n<li>压缩上下文</li>\n<li>构建提示词</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>接口示例</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"interface ContextBuilder {&#10;  build(query: string, docs: Document[]): string&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface ContextBuilder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  build(query: string, docs: Document[]): string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"6-答案生成器-answer-generator\">6. 答案生成器 (Answer Generator)</h4><p><strong>职责</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>调用 LLM</li>\n<li>解析输出</li>\n<li>格式转换</li>\n<li>自我校验</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>接口示例</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"interface AnswerGenerator {&#10;  generate(context: string): Answer&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface AnswerGenerator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  generate(context: string): Answer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模块化的优势\">模块化的优势</h2><h3 id=\"1-易于替换\">1. 易于替换</h3><p><strong>示例</strong>: 替换嵌入模型</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 旧的 OpenAI 嵌入&#10;class OpenAIEmbedding implements EmbeddingModel {&#10;  /* ... */&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 新的 BGE 嵌入&#10;class BgeEmbedding implements EmbeddingModel {&#10;  /* ... */&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 只需要替换这里&#10;const embeddingModel = new BgeEmbedding();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 旧的 OpenAI 嵌入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OpenAIEmbedding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EmbeddingModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 新的 BGE 嵌入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BgeEmbedding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EmbeddingModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只需要替换这里</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> embeddingModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BgeEmbedding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-易于测试\">2. 易于测试</h3><p><strong>示例</strong>: 单元测试检索器</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 可以 Mock 向量数据库&#10;const mockVectorDB = createMockVectorDB(sampleDocs);&#10;const retriever = new Retriever(embeddingModel, mockVectorDB);&#10;&#10;// 测试检索&#10;const results = retriever.retrieve(&#39;test query&#39;, 5);&#10;expect(results.length).toBe(5);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可以 Mock 向量数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mockVectorDB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createMockVectorDB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sampleDocs);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> retriever</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Retriever</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(embeddingModel, mockVectorDB);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 测试检索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retriever.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">retrieve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test query'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-易于复用\">3. 易于复用</h3><p><strong>示例</strong>: 多个应用共享模块</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"应用 A: 客服机器人&#10;应用 B: 内部知识库&#10;应用 C: 文档问答&#10;&#10;都使用:&#10;- 同一个检索器&#10;- 同一个嵌入模型&#10;- 同一个向量数据库\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>应用 A: 客服机器人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>应用 B: 内部知识库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>应用 C: 文档问答</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>都使用:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 同一个检索器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 同一个嵌入模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 同一个向量数据库</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"4-团队协作\">4. 团队协作</h3><p><strong>示例</strong>: 多人并行开发</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"团队成员 A: 开发检索器&#10;团队成员 B: 开发查询处理器&#10;团队成员 C: 开发答案生成器&#10;&#10;通过接口定义，并行开发，最后集成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>团队成员 A: 开发检索器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>团队成员 B: 开发查询处理器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>团队成员 C: 开发答案生成器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>通过接口定义，并行开发，最后集成</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模块化的实现原则\">模块化的实现原则</h2><h3 id=\"1-接口隔离\">1. 接口隔离</h3><p><strong>每个模块只定义必要的接口</strong>，不要暴露内部细节。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-依赖注入\">2. 依赖注入</h3><p><strong>通过构造函数传入依赖</strong>，不要在模块内部创建。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 👍 好：依赖注入&#10;class Retriever {&#10;  constructor(&#10;    private embedding: EmbeddingModel,&#10;    private vectorDB: VectorDB,&#10;  ) {}&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ❌ 不好：内部创建&#10;class Retriever {&#10;  constructor() {&#10;    this.embedding = new OpenAIEmbedding(); // 硬编码&#10;    this.vectorDB = new Pinecone(); // 硬编码&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 👍 好：依赖注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Retriever</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> embedding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EmbeddingModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> vectorDB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VectorDB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 不好：内部创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Retriever</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.embedding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OpenAIEmbedding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 硬编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.vectorDB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Pinecone</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 硬编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-错误处理\">3. 错误处理</h3><p><strong>每个模块处理自己的错误</strong>，或者向上抛出明确的错误类型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"4-可观测性\">4. 可观测性</h3><p><strong>每个模块记录日志和指标</strong>，方便调试和监控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用\">实际应用</h2><h3 id=\"常见框架的模块化设计\">常见框架的模块化设计</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>模块化程度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LangChain</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>高度模块化，组件丰富</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LlamaIndex</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>模块化，数据连接器多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>完全控制，按需设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"何时不需要过度模块化\">何时不需要过度模块化</h3><ul>\n<li>简单的原型（模块化开销大于收益）</li>\n<li>一次性脚本（不需要可维护性）</li>\n<li>非常小的项目（代码量不足以分模块）</li>\n<li>团队只有 1 人（无协作需求）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>过度模块化会导致间接层过多、调试困难、代码跳转频繁。正确的做法是先用最简单的结构跑通流程，当某个模块需要替换或独立测试时再抽象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((模块化 RAG))&#10;    核心模块&#10;      用户接口&#10;      编排层&#10;      查询处理器&#10;      检索器&#10;      上下文构建器&#10;      答案生成器&#10;    优势&#10;      易于替换&#10;      易于测试&#10;      易于复用&#10;      团队协作&#10;    实现原则&#10;      接口隔离&#10;      依赖注入&#10;      错误处理&#10;      可观测性&#10;    框架支持&#10;      LangChain&#10;      LlamaIndex&#10;      自定义实现\">mindmap\n  root((模块化 RAG))\n    核心模块\n      用户接口\n      编排层\n      查询处理器\n      检索器\n      上下文构建器\n      答案生成器\n    优势\n      易于替换\n      易于测试\n      易于复用\n      团队协作\n    实现原则\n      接口隔离\n      依赖注入\n      错误处理\n      可观测性\n    框架支持\n      LangChain\n      LlamaIndex\n      自定义实现</pre><ul>\n<li>拆分成独立模块，每个模块职责明确</li>\n<li>定义清晰的接口</li>\n<li>使用依赖注入</li>\n<li>易于替换、测试、复用、协作</li>\n<li>不要过度模块化，根据需要</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模块化 RAG","id":"模块化-rag"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要模块化","id":"为什么需要模块化"},{"level":2,"text":"RAG 的模块划分","id":"rag-的模块划分"},{"level":3,"text":"核心模块","id":"核心模块"},{"level":3,"text":"模块职责详解","id":"模块职责详解"},{"level":4,"text":"1. 用户接口 (Interface)","id":"1-用户接口-interface"},{"level":4,"text":"2. 编排层 (Orchestrator)","id":"2-编排层-orchestrator"},{"level":4,"text":"3. 查询处理器 (Query Processor)","id":"3-查询处理器-query-processor"},{"level":4,"text":"4. 检索器 (Retriever)","id":"4-检索器-retriever"},{"level":4,"text":"5. 上下文构建器 (Context Builder)","id":"5-上下文构建器-context-builder"},{"level":4,"text":"6. 答案生成器 (Answer Generator)","id":"6-答案生成器-answer-generator"},{"level":2,"text":"模块化的优势","id":"模块化的优势"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 易于替换","id":"1-易于替换"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 易于测试","id":"2-易于测试"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 易于复用","id":"3-易于复用"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 团队协作","id":"4-团队协作"},{"level":2,"text":"模块化的实现原则","id":"模块化的实现原则"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 接口隔离","id":"1-接口隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 依赖注入","id":"2-依赖注入"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 错误处理","id":"3-错误处理"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 可观测性","id":"4-可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用","id":"实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"常见框架的模块化设计","id":"常见框架的模块化设计"},{"level":3,"text":"何时不需要过度模块化","id":"何时不需要过度模块化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高级 RAG 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rag-knowledge-systems/rag-architecture/advanced-rag-pattern"},"next":{"title":"Agentic RAG 智能体检索增强生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rag-knowledge-systems/rag-architecture/agentic-rag"}}